ic Flight Levels - altitudes and flight level conversion table for crossing Russia, China, etc\n\n• convert units for Fuel Flow, Distance, Weight, Fluid, Surface Area, and Speed, including Beaufort\n• convert units for Angles, including % Slope\n• convert units for Temperature, Air Pressure and Power, including Jet Engine Thrust\n• convert Mach-CAS-EAS-TAS based on TAT / SAT and Pressure Altitude\n\n• E6B flight computer - Wind Triangle calculations\n• calculate Runway Crosswind\n• calculate Obstacle Climb Gradient and required Rate of Climb\n• calculate Track Time\n\nCrewLounge CONVERT runs in 15 different languages (English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, etc). Contact us to translate the app in your language!\n\nThis app is one of the popular apps from the CrewLounge AERO aviation suite. However, CrewLounge CONVERT is a standalone app, no registration or subscription required.", "languageCodesISO2A": ["BG", "CS", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "EL", "HU", "IT", "PT", "RO", "RU", "ES", "SV", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes": "18403328", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://crewlounge.aero", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}